<item><title>Benin sets 2027 secondary education budget at 124.838.383.589 francs CFA</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bj/benin-sets-2027-secondary-education-budget-at-124-838-383-f414f5/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bj/benin-sets-2027-secondary-education-budget-at-124-838-383-f414f5/</guid><category>Benin</category><description>Minister Clément Kouchadé presented a plan that includes teacher recruitment, school repairs and adult education centres.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 09:44:55 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/bj/benin-sets-2027-secondary-education-budget-at-124-838-383-f414f5/share.jpg" length="42551" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/bj/benin-sets-2027-secondary-education-budget-at-124-838-383-f414f5/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
